:"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/deployments","created_at":"2017-12-16T14:19:02Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T19:55:30Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-12T03:08:10Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yewstack/yew.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yewstack/yew.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yewstack/yew.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yewstack/yew","homepage":"https://yew.rs","size":17267,"stargazers_count":32201,"watchers_count":32201,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":1455,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":155,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["asmjs","concurrency","elm","emscripten","gui","hacktoberfest","jsx","multithreading","rust","wasm","web","web-framework","webworkers"],"visibility":"public","forks":1455,"open_issues":155,"watchers":32201,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"<!-- Please limit issues to one question or a theme of a few closely related questions -->\r\n<!-- If you're really stuck, feel free chat with us on our Discord server: https://discord.gg/VQck8X4 -->\r\n\r\n#### Question\r\nI'm trying to create a `Menu` component similar to [nested_list](https://github.com/yewstack/yew/tree/master/examples/nested_list) example. I successfully create them, so creating menus looks good and compiler guaranties, that `<Menu>` contains only `<MenuItem>` elements:\r\n```rust\r\nhtml!{\r\n  <Menu>\r\n    <MenuItem>{\"item 1\"}</MenuItem>\r\n    <MenuItem>{\"item 2\"}</MenuItem>\r\n    <MenuItem>{\"item 3\"}</MenuItem>\r\n    //<div /> -- not compiled which is good!\r\n  </Menu>\r\n}\r\n```\r\nNow I want to compose that Menu component with `TreeTable` component and add menu that can manipulate visibility of columns. So I need to populate menu based on columns text.\r\n```rust\r\nhtml!{\r\n  <Menu>\r\n    {for self.columns.iter().map(|column| ???)}\r\n  </Menu>\r\n}\r\n```\r\nThat is not compiled, because `{for ...}` returns `Html` (aka `VNode`), and not the `MenuItem` component. So is there any way to create `MenuItem` by code like that?","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/issues/1524/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/issues/1524/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/issues/comments/682132292","html_url":"https://github.com/yewstack/yew/issues/1527#issuecomment-682132292","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yewstack/yew/issues/1527","id":682132292,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY4MjEzMjI5Mg==","user":{"login":"Mingun","id":450131,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MDEzMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/450131?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingun","html_url":"https://github.com/Mingun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/us